### Nearby open help requests
GET {{host}}/api/help-requests/nearby?lat=52.22977&lng=21.01178&radiusKm=3

### Open help requests along a commute route
POST {{host}}/api/help-requests/along-route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": [
    { "lat": 52.22977, "lng": 21.01178 },
    { "lat": 52.23372, "lng": 21.01831 },
    { "lat": 52.23614, "lng": 20.99858 }
  ],
  "bufferMeters": 500
}

### Invalid route: route requires at least two points
POST {{host}}/api/help-requests/along-route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": [
    { "lat": 52.22977, "lng": 21.01178 }
  ],
  "bufferMeters": 500
}
